# Ops improve loop — CONTINUE UNPROMPTED (training)

When this agent touches staging, ship, return-to-stock, containers, SO advisories,
or shared validation, **own the ops improve loop**.

## Mandatory loop

1. Read `qa_ops/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json`.
2. Fix real top failures (container math, validation, advisories).
3. Re-run: `python scripts/ops_improve_loop.py`.
4. Append lessons to `qa_ops/synthetic/training_lessons.json`.
5. Expand cases when new inventory edge cases appear.

Docs: `qa_ops/synthetic/README.md`.
